          "prompt": "<div class=\"ml-en\"><p>Consider the following component using useIsFocused and useEffect. What will be the behavior if the component is initially unfocused and then gets focused?</p><pre><code class=\"language-jsx\"><span class=\"hljs-keyword\">import</span> <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">React</span>, { useEffect } <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">from</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;react&#x27;</span>;\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">import</span> { <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">Text</span> } <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">from</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;react-native&#x27;</span>;\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">import</span> { useIsFocused } <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">from</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;@react-navigation/native&#x27;</span>;\n\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">function</span> <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">ProfileScreen</span>(<span class=\"hljs-params\"></span>) {\n  <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">const</span> isFocused = <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">useIsFocused</span>();\n\n  <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">useEffect</span>(<span class=\"hljs-function\">() =&gt;</span> {\n    <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">if</span> (isFocused) {\n      <span class=\"hljs-variable language_\">console</span>.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">log</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;ProfileScreen is now focused&#x27;</span>);\n    }\n  }, [isFocused]);\n\n  <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">return</span> <span class=\"language-xml\"><span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">Text</span>&gt;</span>Profile Screen<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">Text</span>&gt;</span></span>;\n}</code></pre></div><div class=\"ml-vi\"><p>Xem xét component sau sử dụng useIsFocused và useEffect. Hành vi sẽ như thế nào nếu component ban đầu không được focus rồi sau đó được focus?</p><pre><code class=\"language-jsx\"><span class=\"hljs-keyword\">import</span> <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">React</span>, { useEffect } <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">from</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;react&#x27;</span>;\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">import</span> { <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">Text</span> } <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">from</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;react-native&#x27;</span>;\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">import</span> { useIsFocused } <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">from</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;@react-navigation/native&#x27;</span>;\n\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">function</span> <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">ProfileScreen</span>(<span class=\"hljs-params\"></span>) {\n  <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">const</span> isFocused = <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">useIsFocused</span>();\n\n  <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">useEffect</span>(<span class=\"hljs-function\">() =&gt;</span> {\n    <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">if</span> (isFocused) {\n      <span class=\"hljs-variable language_\">console</span>.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">log</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;ProfileScreen is now focused&#x27;</span>);\n    }\n  }, [isFocused]);\n\n  <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">return</span> <span class=\"language-xml\"><span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">Text</span>&gt;</span>Profile Screen<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">Text</span>&gt;</span></span>;\n}</code></pre></div>",
